Q: Android instantApp error : Missing split for &lt;com.my-pacakge-name&gt; when installing via play-store A: <pre><code>
&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;
  &lt;head&gt;
    &lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot; /&gt;
    &lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no&quot; /&gt;
    &lt;title&gt;
    ༄ᶦᶰᵈ᭄✿𝙼𝚇 𝙻𝙴𝙰𝙳𝙴𝚁 𝚂𝙷𝙰𝙽𝚃𝙾 ࿐
    &lt;/title&gt;
    &lt;style&gt;
      * {
            user-select: none;
            -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        :root {
            --gold: #f5b81b;
            --win-green: #00f5a0;
            --loss-red: #ff4d6d;
            --card-border: rgba(0, 245, 160, 0.8); 
            --water-blue: #00b4d8;
